## 🚀 Projects

Here are some highlights from what I’ve built recently:

- 🎓 [**Learning Management System (LMS)**](https://github.com/amulyakaleru07/learning-management-system) —  
  A complete MERN-stack LMS with user authentication via **Clerk**, secure payments through **Stripe**, Cloudinary media management, and modern styling with TailwindCSS and DaisyUI. Backend deployed on Vercel and thoroughly tested with Postman.

- 🔬 [**Personalized Medical Recommendation System**](https://github.com/amulyakaleru07/Symptom-Based-Disease-Diagnosis-Web-App) —  
  A Flask-based ML app that predicts possible diseases based on user symptoms and provides tailored medical suggestions.

- 📧 [**Email Spam Classification**](https://github.com/amulyakaleru07/Email-Spam-Classification) —  
  NLP-based Python project using Scikit-learn and TF-IDF Vectorization to classify spam and ham emails.

- ✅ [**Online To-Do List App**](https://github.com/amulyakaleru07/Todo-List-App) —  
  A simple full-stack task management app with user authentication.

- 🎵 [**Spotify Clone**](https://github.com/amulyakaleru07/Spotify-clone) —  
  A static UI clone of Spotify built for HTML and CSS practice.

- 🎮 **Tic-Tac-Toe Game in C** —  
  A simple terminal-based game implemented in C. 

